 "runtime_s": 495,
 "note": "D = SD across the set's members of the held-out score in the same repeat, after putting each member on a common scale within each (repeat, held-out fold): z = z-score of log-odds (endoscopy: mean sample logit), rank = within-fold percentile rank, prob = raw probability. Errors, M, cut-offs, band, CNV/LATE fixes, budget rule exactly as UNC (clean L-IMG, fold training 90%-sensitivity cut-off, R49 mean-logit gate). Flexible control = UNC's piecewise quadratic in (log-odds - cut-off) + cell entropy of the clean L-IMG probability; stricter control adds the ensemble mean (z scale) and its square. Repeat-mean counts; patient bootstrap RandomState(0); cluster Wald p with patient clusters; CV AUROC = 5-fold patient-grouped held-out"
}